{"id":"superior","lemma":"superior","pos":"adj","rank":1317,"glosses":["superior","better","upper, higher"],"ipa":"/supeˈɾjoɾ/","forms":{"femininePlural":"superiores"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cb/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-superior.wav","examples":[{"text":"Recuerda que soy tu superior.","en":"Remember that I outrank you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/523229","words":[{"g":"to remember","l":"recordar"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"your"},null]},{"text":"Es superior a mí.","en":"It's beyond me.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/58768","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"to"},{"g":"me"}]},{"text":"Sé respetuoso con tus superiores, si tienes alguno.","en":"Be respectful to your superiors, if you have any.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/691615","words":[{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"},{"g":"respectful"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"your"},null,{"g":"if, whether"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"someone"}]},{"text":"¿Puedes, por favor, poner este libro en el estante superior?","en":"Could you please put this book on the top shelf?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460045","words":[{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},null,null,{"g":"to put, to place"},{"g":"this"},{"g":"book"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"existing, being"},null],"phrases":[[1,3,"please"]]},{"text":"Es un error pensar que los hombres son superiores a las mujeres.","en":"It is wrong to think that men are superior to women.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"error"},{"g":"to think, ponder"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"man","l":"hombre"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"woman","l":"mujer"}]}]}